      "title_cn": "古尔曼：苹果首款触屏MacBook Pro北京时间10月29日发布",
      "title_en": "Gurman: Apple's first touchscreen MacBook Pro to launch October 29 Beijing time",
      "title_original": "古尔曼：苹果首款触屏 MacBook Pro 北京时间 10 月 29 日发布，标志公司产品策略迎来重大转变",
      "source": "IT之家",
      "published_at": "2026-10-25T14:37:55+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/017/711.htm",
      "category": "consumer_tech",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "彭博社记者马克·古尔曼称，苹果首款触屏MacBook Pro将于北京时间10月29日凌晨1点亮相，引入触控、OLED屏幕和新交互界面。产品有14英寸和16英寸两种尺寸，机身更轻，加入灵动岛，售价预计高于起售价2499美元的高端MacBook Pro。",
      "what_happened_en": "Bloomberg's Mark Gurman reported that Apple's first touchscreen MacBook Pro will debut at 1 a.m. Beijing time on October 29, adding touch, an OLED screen and a new interface. It comes in 14-inch and 16-inch sizes, is lighter, adds Dynamic Island, and is expected to cost more than the $2,499 high-end MacBook Pro.",
      "why_it_matters": "此举将逆转苹果长期对触屏笔记本的抵触，并重塑Mac与iPad的产品区隔。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The launch would reverse Apple's long resistance to touchscreen laptops and reshape its Mac-iPad product split.",
